      "message": "For now, changing `repr_command` seems like more trouble than it\u0027s worth. It\u0027s currently called in 3 places:\n1. This one, `jobserver.popen`.\n2. In `Zmake.build` immediately before calling `jobserver.popen`. The resulting log lines are redundant and right next to each other.\n3. In `get_process_failure_msg`, after the process has terminated. I don\u0027t see a way to get the environment from a completed `subprocess.CompletedProcess`. In any case, each call to to `get_process_failure_msg` is preceded by a call to `jobserver.popen`, so logging the full command again is a little redundant.",
